To view the databases names : 
         show databases;
to create a database :
     create database database_name;

each and every query i write need to perform in this database. the command will be used :
      use database_name;

to delete a database :
  DROP DATABASE database_name;


To alter :
   alter database read only = 1; -----> only read the database
   alter database read only = 0; -----> normal mode 
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Creating a table :
      create table table_name( arguments);
         eg :
          create table employee(
    emp_id int,name varchar(50),salary decimal(7,2), joining_data date);




